3
00:03:52.610 --> 00:04:02.190
基于黑白电影《GOJIRA A Tomoyuki Tanaka》在东京的托霍制作

4
00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:11.760
此分類上一篇: Avco Embassy and Joe Levine Godzilla, King of the Monsters for Paramount

5
00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:14.900
饰演 Raymond Burr

6
00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:24.410
和 Akira Takarada, Akihiko Hirata Takashi Shimura, Momoko Kochi

7
00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:32.280
原创日本版由Takeo Murata和Ishiro Honda编写

8
00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:38.120
艺术导演:Satoshi Chuko

9
